      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unity_Township%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Settlers petitioned to split from Mount Pleasant Township, leading to Unity Township’s incorporation on September 23, 1789.",
